<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="line-height: 15px; height: 15px; width: 680px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards - Rewarding the spirit of Australian business</font></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img alt="Qantas" border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2028492558/QA0006-Module-Header-Brand-Extended+Qantas+banner+2040x210+201902.jpg" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2028529350/Qantas_181126_Business+Shoot_05_673_V1+1360x907.jpg" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" width="680"></font></td></tr></tbody></table><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h2" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 26px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">An exclusive offer for your business</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thanks again for chatting with me over the phone earlier today.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">At Qantas Business Rewards, we're all about rewarding the spirit of Australian business. Which is why I'm delighted to provide you with an exclusive offer for your business.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h3" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Your exclusive offer</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">As a valued Qantas Business Rewards member, you have the opportunity to earn a single entry&nbsp;<b>Qantas Lounge Invitation</b>&nbsp;per <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">xxx</span> bookings made via Qantas Business Rewards, or through your preferred travel agent.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Simply make <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">xxx</span> eligible bookings* from&nbsp;<b>1 March to 31 March 2019</b>&nbsp;for travel by&nbsp;<b>30 April 2019</b>&nbsp;to earn a Qantas Lounge Invitation, which you can use at selected Qantas Club Domestic and Qantas International Business lounges. Each time you make <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">xxx</span> bookings, you'll receive an additional Qantas Club pass.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Remember, when making a booking for a Qantas Business Rewards flight, don't forget to add your business' ABN and the travellers Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number. This ensures your business^ earns Qantas Points and the traveller their Qantas Frequent Flyer Points and Status Credits<sup class="salesforce_curl" style="font-size: small; line-height: 0px;">~</sup>.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a class="underline three" href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/tools/book-flights" target="_blank" title="Book now" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">Book now</a>&nbsp;or via your preferred travel agent.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 15px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 23px; margin: 0px; height: 23px;"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Important information</font></h3></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" bgcolor="#F4F5F6" width="600" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 15px; height: 15px; margin: 0px; width: 600px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">A business must be a Qantas Business Rewards Member to earn Qantas Points for the business. Membership of Qantas Business Rewards and the earning of Qantas Points as a business are subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Business Rewards Terms and Conditions</a>.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">* Subject to availability, not available on all flights or days. Offer ends 11:59pm (AEDT) 31 March unless sold out prior. Qantas Business Rewards Members must (a) book an eligible flight between 12.01am (AEDT) 1 March 2019 and 11.59pm (AEDT) 31 March 2019 for travel between 1 March 2019 to 30 April 2019, (b) quote registered Qantas Business Rewards ABN and Flyer's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number at the time of booking (c) book travel via Qantas Business Rewards, an IATA or TIDs registered travel agency or ticketed via an approved Ticketing Consolidator. An eligible flight means a domestic or international flight which has a Qantas 'QF' flight number on the ticket that is purchased in Australia; is operated by Qantas or American Airlines or Emirates; has a ticket number commencing with '081'; and is booked and travelled for business on or after the date the business registers for Qantas Business Rewards.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#definationAirline" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Exclusions apply</a>. Other conditions apply. Travel agents or customers on a Corporate Deal with Qantas are not eligible for this offer.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#definationAirline" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">See full terms and conditions</a>. Not to be used in conjunction with any other offer.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">^ Qantas Points for business are offered under the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#airlineterms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas' Terms and Conditions</a>&nbsp;and earning thresholds apply. Qantas Points earned from air travel are determined in accordance with the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/airlineearntable" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Airline Earn Table</a>. A Member's ABN and traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number must be quoted at the time of booking to earn Qantas Points for both the business and the traveller. An eligible flight means a domestic or international flight which has a Qantas 'QF' flight number on the ticket that is purchased in Australia; is operated by Qantas, Emirates or American Airlines; has a ticket number commencing with '081'; and is booked and travelled for business on or after the date the business registers for Qantas Business Rewards.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#definationAirline" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Exclusions apply</a>.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">~ You must be a Qantas Frequent Flyer member to earn Qantas Points. A joining fee may apply. Membership and Qantas Points are subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/program/terms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Frequent Flyer program Terms and Conditions</a>. Qantas Points and Status Credits (where applicable) are earned on&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/program/terms#eligibleflights" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">eligible flights</a>&nbsp;with a Qantas or applicable&nbsp;<b>one</b>world® Alliance Airline or Airline Partner flight number on your ticket. Qantas Points and Status Credits may not be earned on some fare types and booking classes. See&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/program/terms#eligibleflights" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">terms and conditions</a>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/flying/airline-earning" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Airline Earning Tables</a>&nbsp;for details on the conditions for the applicable airline.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>